===Etymology===
From {{der|en|yi|שפּריץ|tr=shprits}} (the noun) and {{m|yi|שפּריצן|tr=shpritsn}} (the verb).

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/spɹɪts/|/ʃpɹɪts/}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɪts}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-spritz.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|es}}

